    "t27 specs/hf/model_card_hslm.t27 14/14: the --backend ml binary of ml/train_hslm.t27 trained the whole HSLM, huggingface.co/playra/hslm-t27-2m",
    "t27 specs/fpga/ddr3_ternary_matvec.t27: tern-tc-9m layer-0 K weights in DDR3, mat-vec receipt PASS on the AX7203",
    "t27 specs/igla/own_model.t27"
];

